  "description": "Ordinary least squares with inference for .NET, at statsmodels parity: standard errors, t statistics, p-values, confidence intervals, R-squared and its adjusted form, the overall F test and a variance inflation factor per regressor. Solved through a Householder QR rather than the normal equations. Spans in, one summary out, and no dependencies outside Lodestar.",
